{"obsah":"<p>We held a slightly different camp – or rather a Wednesday afternoon course – for enthusiasts who want to improve their bike technique. A few enduro riders and one action-loving female biker came along; with Katarína Tóthová they went through the basics and also threw themselves into fine-tuning berms and the other delights you meet on and off the trail.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_193526_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_193526_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246121\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_193238_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_193238_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246119\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_173914_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_173914_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-246122\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F05%2F20240508_173835_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebas